  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protection of Family Links(PFL) to Alleviate the Suffering and to Contribute to Peacebuilding in Conflict-affected Commu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Families of those unaccounted for as a result of the conflicts in Syria are more likely to see the fate and whereabouts of the missing clarified, and when alive, re-establish family contacts and be reunited with family members. 2. Families of those unaccounted for as a result of the conflicts in Syria, be they in Syria, Lebanon or Jordan, have improved their ability to deal with the multifaceted consequences resulting from their family member&apos;s disappearance by having their specific needs and rights better understood and addressed, by building a network of solidarity around them and by facilitating their access to services provided by the ICRC, National Societies, and other service providers.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increase the likelihood for families of those unaccounted for as a result of the conflict in Syria to see the fate and whereabouts of the missing clarified, and when alive, re-establish family contacts and be reuited with family members, and improve the families&apos; ability to deal with the multifaceted consequences resulting from their family member&apos;s disappearance.- &#xC2DC;&#xB9AC;&#xC544; &#xBD84;&#xC7C1;&#xC73C;&#xB85C; &#xC2E4;&#xC885;&#xB41C; &#xC774;&#xB4E4;&#xC758; &#xAC00;&#xC871;&#xC774; &#xC2E4;&#xC885;&#xC790;&#xB4E4;&#xC758; &#xC0DD;&#xC0AC;&#xC640; &#xC18C;&#xC7AC;&#xB97C; &#xD655;&#xC778;&#xD560; &#xAC00;&#xB2A5;&#xC131;&#xC774; &#xB192;&#xC544;&#xC9C0;&#xACE0;, &#xC0DD;&#xC874; &#xC2DC; &#xAC00;&#xC871;&#xACFC;&#xC758; &#xC5F0;&#xB77D; &#xBC0F; &#xC7AC;&#xACB0;&#xD569;&#xC774; &#xAC00;&#xB2A5;
- &#xC2DC;&#xB9AC;&#xC544;, &#xB808;&#xBC14;&#xB17C;, &#xC694;&#xB974;&#xB2E8;&#xC5D0; &#xC788;&#xB294; &#xC2E4;&#xC885;&#xC790; &#xAC00;&#xC871;&#xB4E4;&#xC774; &#xC2E4;&#xC885;&#xC73C;&#xB85C; &#xC778;&#xD55C; &#xBCF5;&#xD569;&#xC801;&#xC778; &#xACB0;&#xACFC;&#xC5D0; &#xB300;&#xCC98; &#xAC00;&#xB2A5;</narrative>
